From 22a5058d58db20c37a4dcda175a62232c943e54e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: netplay <netplay@localhost>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 18:47:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Whole-core simulation for netplay's freeze (sim/)

GHDL (in Docker) translates the VHDL to Verilog, with simulation-only
models of the Altera RAMs and arithmetic; Verilator builds main.v with
the joypad ports and a C++ harness that models the memories as SNES.sv
does. snes_sim prints per-frame hashes (video, audio, WRAM, VRAM, ARAM);
--compare runs a machine whose clock is gated at random frame ticks
beside one that never stops and compares every output on every cycle.
